        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "When your patron appeared, it was as an unfathomably large shadow beneath the waves, possibly as an ancient denizen of the vast waters like a kraken. Whether channeling the lethal terror of an oceanic predator or singing the ancestral wisdom of its gentle giants, your leviathan patron brings you lessons from the unplumbed depths of the world."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
