      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Lesson of Surface and Seas",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " Your patron teaches of the dangers and wonders of its domain, even at the very edges of the water. You gain the "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "fff40827-5581-5c28-ae3a-4759e4c1498b"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " hex cantrip, and your familiar learns Dizzying Colors or Grease."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Familiar of Overwhelming Tides",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " Your familiar constantly drips with ocean water. When you Cast or Sustain a hex, you can cause a small wave to surge forth from your familiar. One creature within 10 feet of your familiar is pushed 5 feet away from your familiar."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
